{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47220","headline":"题慧山泉 · 若水","name":"题慧山泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石脉绽寒光，松根喷晓凉。\n注缾云母滑，漱齿茯苓香。\n野客偷煎茗，山僧借净牀。\n安禅何所问，孤月在中央。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"若水","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}